t x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv x78zum5"><span dir="auto" title="Tanu" style="min-height: 0px;" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu x1jchvi3 xjb2p0i xo1l8bm x17mssa0 x1ic7a3i xnpuxes">Tanu</span></div></div></div><div class="xhslqc4 x1c4vz4f x2lah0s x1pg5gke xdzw4kq x193iq5w x1xxsxie x7r5mf7 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv xuxw1ft" data-testid="cell-frame-primary-detail"><span class="x140p0ai x1gufx9m x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1lliihq x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px; --x-8dd7yt: -0.0137em; --x-hxtmnb: 0.0137em;">Wednesday</span></div></div><div class="x6s0dn4 xhslqc4 x78zum5 x1nxh6w3 x1fc57z9 xr9ek0c xisnujt" data-testid="cell-frame-secondary"><div class="xjbqb8w x1iyjqo2 x1f6kntn x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1yc453h xlyipyv xuxw1ft xo1l8bm"><span class="x78zum5 x1cy8zhl" title="‪List of Practical Questions / Experiments
1. Create webpages using HTML comments (&lt;!-- --&gt;) for documentation and readability.
2. Design a webpage using the &lt;ADDRESS&gt; tag for displaying contact information.
3. Create webpages using horizontal rules (&lt;HR&gt;) for content separation.
4. Create and save external CSS files and link them with HTML pages.
5. Design attractive webpage layouts using CSS alignment and positioning.
6. Design a student registration form using HTML form elements and CSS styling.
7. Design an online college admission form with proper CSS styling.
8. Design a webpage for generating resumes using forms and styled layouts.
9. Create a webpage for a local business/shop with products and services.
10. Design an HTML form for submitting: Complaints, Suggestions, Queries.
11. Teacher can allot other experiments also.‬" data-testid="last-msg-status"><div class="x78zum5 x1okw0bk x1xp8n7a xamitd3 xl56j7k x1rv0e52 x16q7b9a"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="18" width="18" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="currentColor"><title>wds-ic-read</title><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.73 6.01a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15l.01.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41L7.6 18.01a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05c-.26 0-.52-.11-.71-.3l-4.03-4.09a.99.99 0 0 1 0-1.41.99.99 0 0 1 1.41 0l3.25 3.29 7.99-9.86Zm5.71.12a1 1 0 0 1 1.41-.15h-.01a1 1 0 0 1 .15 1.41l-8.41 10.45a1 1 0 0 1-.73.37h-.05a1 1 0 0 1-.71-.3l-1.36-1.26a.55.55 0 0 1-.02-.81l.56-.68c.21-.2.53-.21.75-.03l.71.58 7.71-9.58Z"></path></svg></span></div><span dir="ltr" style="min-height: 0px;" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu xnpuxes">List of Practical Questions / Experiments
1. Create webpages using HTML comments (&lt;!-- --&gt;) for documentation and readability.
2. Design a webpage using the &lt;ADDRESS&gt; tag for displaying contact information.
3. Create webpages using horizontal rules (&lt;HR&gt;) for content separation.
4. Create and save external CSS files and link them with HTML pages.
5. Design attractive webpage layouts using CSS alignment and positioning.
6. Design a student registration form using HTML form elements and CSS styling.
7. Design an online college admission form with proper CSS styling.
8. Design a webpage for generating resumes using forms and styled layouts.
9. Create a webpage for a local business/shop with products and services.
10. Design an HTML form for submitting: Complaints, Suggestions, Queries.
11. Teacher can allot other experiments also.</span></span></div><div role="gridcell" aria-colindex="1" class="xhslqc4 x1c4vz4f x2lah0s x1pg5gke x1fc57z9 xdzw4kq x193iq5w"><span class=""></span><span class=""></span><span class="xtrg13t"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="x10l6tqk xh8yej3 x1g42fcv" style="z-index: 999985; transition: none; height: 76px; transform: translateY(1140px);" role="row" data-testid="list-item-15"><div role="gridcell" class="x1n2onr6" tabindex="0"><div tabindex="-1" class="" aria-selected="false"><div data-testid="cell-frame-container" class="x1280gxy xlr9sxt xvvg52n xwd4zgb xq8v1ta x78zum5 x1q0g3np xy75621 x1hm9lzh x1sa5p1d x71s49j x1n2onr6 x1ypdohk x1ubxc9n xbmkbis xb5mbof xiitwr3 x206yn3"><div class="x78zum5"><div class="x6s0dn4 x78zum5 x1c4vz4f x2lah0s x1y332i5 x18d9i69 xexx8yu x1n1b19v xbmws1g"><div class="x78zum5 x6s0dn4 xl56j7k x5yr21d"><div class="x3nfvp2 x2lah0s x16ye13r x5lhr3w x1plvlek xryxfnj x1n2onr6 x1f65lpj x1dp6k3u x15j2znp xwr2rdz xrw4ojt xg6frx5 xw872ko xhgbb2x xynf4tj xdjs2zz x1r9ni5o xvsnedh x1g7kj8l xqo1zpi x2qsnth xh2ebzn xx38sju x1s928wv x1m1drc7 x1unh1gc x1xrz1ek x1iygr5g x2q1x1w x1j6awrg" style="--x-height: 48px; --x-width: 48px;"><img draggable="false" height="48" width="48" class="xl1xv1r x1c9tyrk xeusxvb x1pahc9y x1ertn4p x1lliihq" alt="" aria-hidden="true" referrerpolicy="origin-when-cross-origin" src="chavi_files/file_002_GJqI.jpg"></div></div></div></div><div class="x78zum5 xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x1iyjqo2 xl56j7k xeuugli x1n1b19v"><div role="gridcell" aria-colindex="2" class="x6s0dn4 x78zum5 xggjnk3 x1yc453h"><div class="x14ug900 x78zum5 x1iyjqo2 x1jchvi3 xdod15v x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1mzt3pk x1yc453h xo1l8bm" data-testid="cell-frame-title"><div class="x1c4vz4f xuce83p x1bft6iq x1i7k8ik xq9mrsl x6s0dn4 x78zum5"><div class="xuxw1ft x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv x78zum5"><span dir="auto" title="Supriya 🫶🏼" style="min-height: 0px;" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu x1jchv